  "questionText": "Consider the following database tables of a sports league.<br><br><b>player(pid,pname,age)</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>team(tid,tname,city,cid)</b><br><b>coach(cid,cname)</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>members(pid,tid)</b><br><br>An instance of the table and an SQL query are given.<br><br><div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; margin: 12px 0 20px 0;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>player</b><br><table style=\"border: 1px solid white; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: center; margin-top: 4px;\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">pid</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">pname</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">age</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">Jasprit</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">31</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">Atharva</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">24</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">3</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">Ishan</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">26</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">4</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">Axar</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">30</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>coach</b><br><table style=\"border: 1px solid white; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: center; margin-top: 4px;\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">cid</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">cname</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">101</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">Ricky</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">102</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">Mark</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">103</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">Trevor</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>team</b><br><table style=\"border: 1px solid white; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: center; margin-top: 4px;\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">tid</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">tname</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">city</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">cid</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">10</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">MI</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">Mumbai</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">102</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">20</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">DC</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">Delhi</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">101</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">30</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">PK</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">Mohali</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">103</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>members</b><br><table style=\"border: 1px solid white; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: center; margin-top: 4px;\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">pid</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">tid</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">1</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">10</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">2</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">30</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">3</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">10</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">4</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 6px 12px;\">20</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>The value returned by the given SQL query is ______ . (Answer in integer)",
  "assetImage": null,
  "codeBlock": "SELECT MIN(P.age)\nFROM player P\nWHERE P.pid IN (\n    SELECT M.pid\n    FROM team T, coach C, members M\n    WHERE C.cname = 'Mark'\n      AND T.cid = C.cid\n      AND M.tid = T.tid\n)",
